presented to XVIII International Congress of Psychology, Moscow, 1966.

Osborne, R. T. "Psychometric Correlates of the Visual Evoked Potential."
Acta Psychologica.  XXIX, 1969.

Thomas, Roger K., Jr. Problems and Procedures in Correlating Electrical
Brain Activity with Cognition.  Louisville, Kentucky: Southern Society
for Philosophy and Psychology, 1968.

Rosenzweig, M. R., Krech, D., Bennett, E. L., and Diamond, M. C.,
"Effects of Environmental Complexity and Training on Brain Chemistry
and Anatomy:  A Replication and Extension."  Journal of Comparative
Physiological Psychology. LV, 1962.
(note -- Rosenzweig's experiments with raising rats in enriched vs.
